      "message": "https://source.corp.google.com/chromeos_public/src/aosp/packages/modules/Bluetooth/upstream/system/gd/rust/linux/stack/src/bluetooth.rs;rcl\u003d37dee534b8b5c1f2a0726ef58f6272bb9c7affdc;l\u003d1430\n\nYou may also check here. This is the place I tended to pass the profile information to the media layer.",
